              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeanie Mueller"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful fullbodied taste, if you like rye bread, anise flavor &amp; molasses you will love this bread, will for sure make again. Recipe made 4 mini Pampered Chef loaves and 1 reg. bread pan size loaf. Baked 35 min.....checked and they were done. Just be sure to do toothpick test."
